DUSD::transferOwnership
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when newOwner is zero address
│   │   ├── it should set pendingOwner to zero address
│   │   └── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted event with zero address
│   ├── when newOwner is current owner (self)
│   │   ├── it should set pendingOwner to current owner
│   │   └── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted event
│   ├── when newOwner is valid address (not zero, not self)
│   │   ├── it should set pendingOwner to newOwner
│   │   ├── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted event
│   │   └── it should not change current owner
│   │   ├── new owner should be able to accept ownership
│   ├── when replacing existing pending owner
│   │   ├── it should replace previous pendingOwner with new address
│   │   └── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted event with new address
│   │   ├── new owner should be able to accept ownership
│   └── when newOwner is same as current pendingOwner
│       ├── it should keep the same pendingOwner
│       └── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted event
│       ├── new owner should be able to accept ownership